:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Favour
<<effects>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-presence>>
<<if !_shrine or _shrine.stage isnot 3 or $location isnot 'forest_raven_shrine'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You are no longer at the shrine.' '你已经不在神社了。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if !_shrinePerson or C.npc.Tsukihan.init isnot 1>>
  <<lanSwitch 'There is nobody waiting on the veranda. You can come back another time.' '廊下没有人在等。改天再来吧。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Tsukihan>><<person1>>
<<if _shrineConfessionReady and !_shrine.favour_result>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan puts the bowl back on the shelf without asking you to fill it. "There is something else. Could you sit with me a moment?" <<He>> moves the papers off the cushion beside <<him>>, then keeps <<his>> hands still in <<his>> lap.' '月羽把碗放回架上，这次没有请你带什么东西。“有别的事。能陪我坐一会儿吗？”<<He>>挪开身旁坐垫上的纸张，把手安安静静地放在膝上。'>><br><br>
  <<icon 'raven-shrine/bench.png'>><<lanLink ['Sit beside Tsukihan (0:10)', '在月羽身旁坐下 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Feelings'>>
    <<deadwood-raven-shrine-act 'feelings'>>
  <</lanLink>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return 'veranda'>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if _shrine.favour_result>>
  <<switch _shrine.favour_result>>
    <<case 'stay'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You agree to stay for five minutes. Tsukihan brings a cushion in from the edge of the veranda, sets another beside it for you, and sits down.<br><br>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
            "You could stay for ten." <<He>> catches your look. "All right. Five. You did say."
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>
            "I was going to ask you sooner." <<He>> looks at the tools left on the board. "Then I thought I should finish something first. I never quite run out of things."
          <<else>>
            "Thank you. I know you have things to do." <<He>> sits rather straight at first, then lets <<his>> shoulders drop.
          <</if>><br><br>
          You talk about little things while the shadows move across the boards. When the time is up, Tsukihan does not reach for another excuse.
          <<if isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>"I like having you here," <<he>> says. "That was what I meant to ask."<<else>>"That was a pleasant break. Thank you for staying."<</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你答应再坐五分钟。月羽把一只坐垫从廊边挪进来，又往旁边添了一只给你，这才坐下。<br><br>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
            “十分钟也行。”<<He>>看见你的眼神，改了口。“好，五分钟。你刚说过了。”
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>
            “刚才就想留你坐坐。”<<He>>看看木板上还没收的工具。“又想着，先干完手头这件再说。结果总还有下一件。”
          <<else>>
            “谢谢。知道你也有自己的事。”<<He>>起初坐得端正，过了一会儿，肩膀才松下来。
          <</if>><br><br>
          你们说着些零碎的小事，日影在廊板上慢慢挪动。时间到了，月羽没有再找别的由头。
          <<if isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>“就是想让你陪着。”<<he>>说，“刚才想说的是这个。”<<else>>“歇这一会儿，舒服多了。谢谢你留下来。”<</if>>
      <</language>><<lstress>><<glove>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint>>
    <<case 'gift'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You give Tsukihan a portion of strawberries. <<He>> rinses them, then selects a small bowl from the shelf.<br><br>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
            "These are mine. I said so first." <<He>> moves the bowl away from a raven leaning down from the rail.
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>
            "I nearly told you to leave them on the offering table. Force of habit." <<He>> keeps the bowl beside <<him>> instead.
          <<else>>
            "You really don't have to bring me things." <<He>> looks down at the berries. "But I did ask, didn't I? Thank you."
          <</if>><br><br>
          Tsukihan takes a berry, leaving the leaves neatly beside the bowl. "Those are good. Next time I go down to the shops, I'm looking for these."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你把一份草莓交给月羽。<<He>>洗好果子，又从架上挑了一只小碗。<br><br>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
            “这份是我的。我先说过了。”栏杆上一只渡鸦正往下探，<<he>>把碗挪远了些。
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>
            “差点又叫你搁到供桌上去。习惯了。”这回，<<he>>把碗留在了自己手边。
          <<else>>
            “来一趟，不用总给我带东西。”<<He>>低头看看果子。“不过这次是我先开口的，对吧。谢谢。”
          <</if>><br><br>
          月羽吃掉一颗，把叶子整齐地放在碗边。“这个甜。下回去镇上，我也找找。”
      <</language>><<glove>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint>>
    <<case 'decline'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You shake your head to let Tsukihan know you cannot do that today.
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
            <<He>> presses <<his>> lips together. "I was only asking." After a moment, <<he>> shifts the tray off the step. "Mind that on your way out."
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>
            "Not even—" <<He>> stops. "All right. Another time, perhaps."
          <<else>>
            "Of course. Don't let me keep you." <<He>> puts the loose things on the board back in order.
          <</if>><br><br>
          Tsukihan bends over the board again, putting the loose tools back in their box one by one.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你摇摇头，表示今天没法答应。
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
            <<He>>抿了抿嘴。“也就是问问。”停了一下，又把台阶上的托盘挪开。“出去时，当心脚下。”
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>
            “一点都——”<<He>>收住话。“好吧。那就改天。”
          <<else>>
            “当然。别让我耽搁了你的事。”<<He>>把木板上零散的东西重新摆好。
          <</if>><br><br>
          月羽重新低下头，把木板上零散的工具一件件收回盒里。
      <</language>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint -1>>
    <<case 'promise'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You nod in agreement: a portion of strawberries, tomorrow before six in the evening.<br><br>
          "Tomorrow, before I close. I'll remember." Tsukihan leaves the little bowl on the shelf.
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>"And not a bowl of leaves with one berry hiding in it." <<He>> smiles. "I know what the birds leave behind."
          <<else>>"You can hand them straight to me. They aren't an offering."<</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你点头应下：明天下午六点前，带一份草莓过来。<br><br>
          “明天关门前。我记着了。”月羽把小碗留在架上。
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>“也别给一碗叶子，里面藏一颗果子。”<<He>>笑了笑，“鸟吃剩的是什么样，我可认得。”
          <<else>>“到时直接交给我就好。这不是供品。”<</if>>
      <</language>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint>>
    <<case 'deliver' 'late'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You take out the promised strawberries. Tsukihan sets <<his>> work aside and comes over to receive them.<br><br>
          <<if _shrine.favour_late>>
            "I thought you had forgotten." <<He>> looks from the berries to you. "I waited until I closed. Next time, tell me if you can't make it."
            You give an apologetic nod. Tsukihan takes the fruit after a moment, then goes to rinse it.
          <<else>>
            "You remembered." Tsukihan takes the berries in both hands. "I did wonder, after you'd gone. It's a long way to come for strawberries."
            <<He>> brings out the bowl <<he>> put aside for them.
          <</if>><br><br>
          "Thank you. I'll enjoy these." <<He>> makes room for you on the veranda while the water drains away.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你取出答应带来的草莓。月羽先放下手头的活，走过来接。<br><br>
          <<if _shrine.favour_late>>
            “还以为你忘了。”<<He>>看看果子，又看看你。“那天等到关门。下次赶不来，跟我说一声吧。”
            你歉然点头。月羽过了一会儿才接过果子，拿去洗了。
          <<else>>
            “你记着呢。”月羽双手接住果子。“你走了之后，我还在想，专为一份草莓跑这么远。”
            <<He>>拿出先前特意留下的小碗。
          <</if>><br><br>
          “谢谢。我慢慢吃。”<<He>>让果子沥着水，又给你腾出廊下的位置。
      <</language>><<glove>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint -1>>
    <<case 'apology'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You shake your head apologetically. Tsukihan understands that the strawberries will not be coming.
          <<if _shrine.favour_late>>
            "I wish you'd told me sooner." <<He>> takes the little bowl down and puts it with the others. "I won't keep waiting, then."
          <<else>>
            "All right. Thank you for telling me." <<He>> returns the little bowl to the stack. "I asked for strawberries, not for you to turn your day upside down."
          <</if>><br><br>
          Tsukihan puts the bowls away, then picks up the cord that still needs sorting.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你歉然摇摇头。月羽明白，那份草莓是等不到了。
          <<if _shrine.favour_late>>
            “早些说就好了。”<<He>>取下特意留下的小碗，放回别的碗旁边。“那我就不等了。”
          <<else>>
            “好。谢谢你提前说。”<<He>>把小碗放回摞好的碗里。“想吃草莓而已，没让你把别的事都搁下。”
          <</if>><br><br>
          月羽收好碗，又拿起还没理顺的绳子。
      <</language>><<if _shrine.favour_late>><<llove>><</if>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint -1>>
  <</switch>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if _shrine.promise gte 0>>
  <<if Math.floor(Time.days) gt _shrine.promise>>
    <<lanSwitch 'The day you promised to bring strawberries has passed. Tsukihan has stacked the little bowl with the others. "I thought you might have changed your mind." <<He>> waits to hear what you have to say.' '约好送草莓的日子已经过了。月羽已经把那只小碗和其他碗摞在了一起。“还以为你改主意了。”<<He>>等着你开口。'>>
  <<elseif Math.floor(Time.days) is _shrine.promise>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You promised to bring a portion of strawberries today, before Tsukihan closes at 18:00. The little bowl is still on the shelf. "Were you able to find some?" <<he>> asks.' '你答应今天18:00关门前，带一份草莓来。小碗仍留在架上。“找到草莓了吗？”<<he>>问。'>>
  <<else>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You promised to bring a portion of strawberries tomorrow, before Tsukihan closes at 18:00. "No need to rush," <<he>> says. "I remembered what we agreed."' '你答应明天18:00关门前，带一份草莓来。“不用赶。”<<he>>说，“说好的时间，我记着呢。”'>>
  <</if>><br><br>
  <<if $foodstuff?.strawberry?.amount gt 0 and !pcAreArmsBound('both') and _shrineMinutes gt 5>>
    <<icon 'tending/strawberry.png'>><<lanLink ['Deliver a portion of strawberries (0:05)', '交给月羽一份草莓 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Favour'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-favour 'deliver'>>
    <</lanLink>><<glove>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint -1>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Cannot keep promise', '告诉月羽办不到了'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Favour'>>
    <<deadwood-raven-shrine-favour 'apology'>>
  <</lanLink>><<if Math.floor(Time.days) gt _shrine.promise>><<llove>><</if>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint -1>><br>
<<elseif _shrine.favour is Math.floor(Time.days)>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan has nothing else to ask of you today. "Go and see to your own things. I have enough here to keep me busy."' '月羽今天没有别的事要请你做了。“忙你的事去吧。我这里也够忙上一阵。”'>><br><br>
<<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.love lt 10>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan checks the cupboard, then closes it again. "Nothing urgent. It can wait until I next go down to town."' '月羽检查了一遍柜子，又把门关好。“不是什么急事。等下回去镇上再说吧。”'>><br><br>
<<elseif Math.floor(Time.days) % 2 is 0>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You are about to turn away when Tsukihan looks up from the board.
      <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
        "Stay a little longer. I haven't sat down for hours." <<He>> pulls a cushion over with <<his>> foot. "Five minutes, just for me."
      <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>
        "Do you have another five minutes?" <<He>> leaves <<his>> tools where they are. "I'd like some company. The work can wait that long."
      <<else>>
        "I ought to rest my hands. Would you care to sit for five minutes?" <<He>> starts to straighten a cushion. "Only if you have time."
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你正要转开身，月羽从木板前抬起头。
      <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
        “再留一会儿。忙了半天，还没坐下呢。”<<He>>用脚挪来一只坐垫。“五分钟，陪陪我。”
      <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>
        “还空得出五分钟吗？”<<He>>暂且放着工具。“想找个人陪着坐坐。这点工夫，活儿还能等。”
      <<else>>
        “也该歇歇手了。要不要一起坐五分钟？”<<He>>动手理好一只坐垫。“你有空的话。”
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<if _shrineMinutes gt 5>>
    <<icon 'raven-shrine/bench.png'>><<lanLink ['Stay a little longer (0:05)', '再陪月羽坐一会儿 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Favour'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-favour 'stay'>>
    <</lanLink>><<lstress>><<glove>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Not today', '今天就不了'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Favour'>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-favour 'decline'>><</lanLink>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint -1>><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Tsukihan is rinsing a little bowl.
      <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
        "Bring me some strawberries. A proper portion, not what the birds leave." <<He>> puts the bowl on the shelf. "I've decided I want something sweet."
      <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>
        "Have you seen any good strawberries?" <<He>> turns the bowl in <<his>> hands. "If you have some to spare, I'd like a portion. For me, this time."
      <<else>>
        "I was thinking about strawberries. The sweet ones, if there's any about." <<He>> dries the bowl. "Could you spare a portion? Don't put yourself out."
      <</if>><br><br>
      "Just hand them to me. If I leave them out for everyone, I know who'll get there first." A raven leans over the rail above the bowl. "If you haven't any now, tomorrow before six would do."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      月羽正洗着一只小碗。
      <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
        “给我带份草莓吧。好好的一份，别是鸟吃剩的。”<<He>>把碗搁到架上。“想吃点甜的了。”
      <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>
        “有没有见到好吃的草莓？”<<He>>把碗在手里转了转。“你若有多的，能分我一份吗？这回是我自己想吃。”
      <<else>>
        “刚才想起草莓了。甜的那种，不知道还有没有。”<<He>>擦干小碗。“能分我一份吗？不方便就算了。”
      <</if>><br><br>
      “直接交给我就好。搁在外头大家一起吃，头一份肯定轮不到我。”一只渡鸦从碗上方的栏杆探下头。“手头没有的话，明天六点前带来也行。”
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<if $foodstuff?.strawberry?.amount gt 0 and !pcAreArmsBound('both') and _shrineMinutes gt 5>>
    <<icon 'tending/strawberry.png'>><<lanLink ['Give Tsukihan a portion of strawberries (0:05)', '给月羽一份草莓 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Favour'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-favour 'gift'>>
    <</lanLink>><<glove>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Promise strawberries tomorrow', '答应明日傍晚送草莓'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Favour'>>
    <<deadwood-raven-shrine-favour 'promise'>>
  <</lanLink>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint>><br>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Not today', '今天就不了'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Favour'>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-favour 'decline'>><</lanLink>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint -1>><br>
<</if>>
<br><<deadwood-raven-shrine-return 'veranda'>>
